## Step 7 — Update `App.tsx` deep link / OAuth callback (line ~168)

### Replace `supabase.auth.getSession()` after OAuth redirect
```ts
// BEFORE:
// Deep link handler calls supabase.auth.getSession() to pick up OAuth tokens

// AFTER:
// Parse the deep link URL manually (VPS sends tokens in the URL):
// dosiqai://auth?access_token=<JWT>&refresh_token=<token>&user=<encoded JSON>

import { saveTokens, saveUser } from './src/lib/apiClient';

// Inside your Linking event handler:
const url = new URL(event.url);
const accessToken = url.searchParams.get('access_token');
const refreshToken = url.searchParams.get('refresh_token');
const userParam = url.searchParams.get('user');

if (accessToken && refreshToken) {
  await saveTokens(accessToken, refreshToken);
  if (userParam) await saveUser(JSON.parse(decodeURIComponent(userParam)));
  // Then trigger authStore.initialize() or set isAuthenticated = true
}
```

